WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 12.1 · Partnerships & Ecosystem Building
Why partner: types of partnership

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Partner for a clear reason, with the type and depth the purpose needs.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Start from an objective you cannot reach alone.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Name the type: community, institutional, corporate, technical, network.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Choose depth: exchange, sharing, coordinating or collaborating.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Tide Line Youth Collective (Community group · idea stage, Indonesia)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Tide Line: village heads to agree sites; a nursery for local seedlings; the school for time with young people; dive operators for boat time.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write the partnerships your objectives need, and why.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
